---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
    <article class="home-intro">
        <h1>Hi, I'm Saksham</h1>
        <p class="subheadline">Software Engineer · IIT Roorkee CS Grad</p>

        <div class="intro-body">
            <p>
                I am a software engineer interested in the systems underneath our applications. My
                curiosity usually drives me toward JVM internals, compilers, language runtimes,
                operating systems, and distributed systems. I like exploring how they are built,
                where they break, and how they can be optimized.
            </p>

            <p>
                Over the past few years, my exploration has led me to build a few experimental
                systems from scratch to understand them better:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>An Operating System from Scratch:</strong> A 32-bit UNIX clone kernel written
                    in C and x86 Assembly. It has its own bootloader, handles interrupts, keyboard input,
                    virtual memory, features a basic memory manager, and renders to a VGA display.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Parsers & Interpreters:</strong> A lightweight, recursive-descent JSON parser
                    in Java, alongside a self-contained math expression evaluator built using functional
                    parser-combinator techniques.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Network & Caching Utilities:</strong> A minimal HTTP proxy server in C++ using
                    RAII for socket safety, and an implementation playground comparing different caching
                    strategies and design patterns.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <p>
                This blog is where I publish deep dives into topics I have gone deep on. Starting
                with a series on Java generics internals.
            </p>

            <p class="blog-cta">
                <a href="/blog">Read the blog →</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .home-intro {
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .home-intro h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .intro-body {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .intro-body p {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .intro-body ul {
        margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .intro-body li {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .blog-cta {
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }

    .blog-cta a {
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .blog-cta a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
